  "cli_result_text": "Submitted the 12 files most relevant to tracing the FastAPI request-validation chain against the httpx request-encoding chain:\n\n**FastAPI (server-side validation/parsing):**\n1. `fastapi/dependencies/utils.py` \u2014 `request_body_to_args`, `get_body_field`, dependency injection and Pydantic model validation for request bodies\n2. `fastapi/encoders.py` \u2014 `jsonable_encoder`, nested model/None handling\n3. `fastapi/exceptions.py` \u2014 `RequestValidationError` (source of 422s)\n4. `fastapi/params.py` \u2014 `Body` field info (defaults, embed behavior)\n5. `fastapi/routing.py` \u2014 `APIRoute`/`APIRouter`, request handling flow, Content-Type negotiation\n6. `fastapi/applications.py` \u2014 app-level wiring of exception handlers and routing\n\n**httpx (client-side request encoding):**\n7. `httpx/_content.py` \u2014 `encode_json`, `encode_request` (JSON serialization, Content-Type header logic)\n8. `httpx/_models.py` \u2014 `Request` class construction\n9. `httpx/_client.py` \u2014 `build_request` (client-side request assembly)\n10. `httpx/_types.py` \u2014 type contracts for request body params\n11. `httpx/_api.py` \u2014 top-level `post`/`request` entry points\n12. `httpx/_multipart.py` \u2014 multipart encoding (contrast case vs JSON)",
